+# Symtropy Documentation v0.7 — Integration Patch Campaign
+
+Date: 2026-07-20
+
+## Added
+
+- Mission, Event, and Contract Grammar
+- Science, Research, and Discovery Contract
+- Worldline Long-Horizon and Endgame Contract
+- Player Authorship, Sandbox, and Modding Contract
+- Multiplayer Social Safety, Griefing, and Moderation
+- World-State Revisitability and Consequence Presentation
+- Canon Registry v0.3
+- v0.7 Integration Patch Campaign
+
+## Integrated
+
+- Added activity, knowledge, authorship, safety, and presentation domains to the System Interaction Map.
+- Connected research and mature-world purpose to progression.
+- Added activity closure and revisit rhythm to the player-experience contract.
+- Extended playtesting for mission grammar, science, authorship, abuse recovery, and longitudinal consequence.
+- Added prototype gates to the roadmap.
